CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_EREBUS_DESCR	Random map that creates a region of a fantasy type world where much of the world is unknown and irrelevant. It allows terrain to be created on a smaller, more detailed scale than planetary maps.	随机地图，生成一片奇幻世界的区域，世界的大部分未知且无关紧要。它允许以比行星级地图更小、更精细的尺度生成地形。
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_FRACTURED_WORLD_DESCR	Evolving plate tectonics map. When the eons come and go, the world slowly changes as the continents drift and break apart, and new islands are created that may be driven into the continents.	演化的板块构造地图。随着纪元来去，大陆漂移、断裂，世界缓慢改变，并生成可能被推向大陆的新岛屿。
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_INLAND_SEA_DESCR	A large sea inhabits the center, surrounded by a thick ring of land.	一片大海居于中央，四周被厚厚的陆地环带包围。
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_MEDIUM_AND_SMALL_DESCR	Realistic world with highly random landmasses medium and small. East and west hemispheres are divided by ocean, although rarely an island chain may connect them.	高度随机的中小型陆块构成的真实世界。东西半球被海洋分隔，尽管偶尔可能有一条岛链将它们相连。
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_PANGAEA_DESCR	Pan-Gaia: "One Earth," a massive single continent.	泛盖亚：“同一个地球”，一块巨大的单一大陆。
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_PERFECT_WORLD_DESCR	Random map that simulates earth-like plate tectonics, geostrophic and monsoon winds and rainfall.	随机地图，模拟类地的板块构造、地转风与季风及降雨。
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_RANDOM_DESCR	Map script which allows to randomly select a map script between Earth3, Erebus, Fractured World, Inland Sea, Medium and Small, PlanetFall, Sea Highlands and Tectonics.	地图脚本，可在 Earth3、Erebus、Fractured World、Inland Sea、Medium and Small、PlanetFall、Sea Highlands 和 Tectonics 之间随机选取一个地图脚本。
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_RING_WORLD_DESCR	Random map based on Larry Niven's famous 'Ringworld' novel. It creates a thin (16 tiles wide) but long map with artificial landmasses and climate.	基于拉里·尼文著名小说《环形世界》的随机地图。它生成一张狭窄（16 格宽）但很长的地图，带有人造陆块与气候。
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_SEA_HIGHLANDS_DESCR	Highlands, valleys and mountain ranges with several bigger lakes.	高地、谷地与山脉，并有若干较大的湖泊。
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_TECTONICS_DESCR	Produces mountain ranges, and simulates plate tectonics, giving more realistic/earthlike terrain (mountain ranges, mountains near coasts like the Andes, or between subcontinents like the Himalaia).	生成山脉，并模拟板块构造，带来更真实/类地的地形（山脉、如安第斯山般靠近海岸的山峰，或如喜马拉雅般位于次大陆之间的山峰）。
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_TERRA_DESCR	Terra generates random land masses similar to those of the planet Earth. All players begin in the Old World. These maps are extra large!	Terra 生成与地球相似的随机陆块。所有玩家都从旧世界开始。这些地图格外巨大！
