CIV4GameText_MinorLeaders.xml	TXT_KEY_LEADER_SALLOS_PEDIA	Duke Sallos appears in the official Scenarios.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE][TAB]Sallos was a soldier from a small and dismal duchy at the edge of the patrian empire. He grew tired of what he thought was a meaningless life. When he captured a Merry Dancer he sacrificed the creature in the hope that something will hear his call. His call was heard and Hyborem answered and offered him seven years of power in exchange for his eternal servitude and that of his descendants (his wife was pregnant with their son Asmodey at the time). Sallos accepted.[PARAGRAPH:1]In those seven years Sallos rose to become a patrian duke. After the time was over he died suddenly and after surviving the torments of hell, he became a ruler there as well.[PARAGRAPH:1]It is unusual for a mortal soul to rise to a duke in the demonic ranks. He maintains his status because his descendants remain devout to Sallos's pledge. They have formed a family secret society called the Daughters of Saleos based on demonic worship and incest (to keep their bloodline of Sallos pure).	萨洛斯公爵在官方剧本中登场。[NEWLINE][NEWLINE][TAB]萨洛斯原是帕特里亚帝国边陲一座又小又阴郁的公国里的一名士兵。他厌倦了自认为毫无意义的生活。当他俘获一名欢舞者时，便将这个生灵献祭出去，指望有什么东西能听到他的呼唤。他的呼唤被听见了，海勃雷姆作出回应，提出以七年的权力换取他与其后裔永世的效忠（当时他的妻子正怀着他们的儿子阿斯莫迪）。萨洛斯答应了。[PARAGRAPH:1]在那七年里，萨洛斯一路攀升，成了帕特里亚的一位公爵。期限一到，他便骤然死去；在熬过地狱的种种折磨之后，他在那里也成了统治者。[PARAGRAPH:1]凡人的灵魂能在恶魔的等级中晋升为公爵，实属罕见。他之所以能保住这一地位，是因为他的后裔始终恪守萨洛斯当年立下的誓约。他们组成了一个名为“萨莱奥斯之女”的家族秘密结社，奉行恶魔崇拜与乱伦（以保持萨洛斯血脉的纯正）。
