CIV4GameText_MultipleProduction.xml	TXT_KEY_CONCEPT_MULTIPLE_PRODUCTION_PEDIA	[H1]Multiple Production[\\H1][PARAGRAPH:2]This game option changes how production overflow is handled in cities. When production overflow floods from overflow capacity, it is used in the next queue item immediately, not converted into gold. When the production overflow in a city is high enough to finish the next item or items in the production queue, they will be finished in the same turn too.[PARAGRAPH:2]This rule is not applied to Rituals and Wonders, as it could allow to accumulate overflow in order to build them faster once that their requirements are met. Production overflow isn't carried from normal production to items produced using food or viceversa, as that would allow to prevent halting city growth by accumulating enough overflow. Production overflow is carried between items produced with food in the same way it happens for normal production.	[H1]多重生产[\\H1][PARAGRAPH:2]这个游戏选项改变了城市中生产溢出的处理方式。当生产溢出超过溢出上限而外泄时，它会立即用于队列中的下一个项目，而不是转化为金币。当一座城市的生产溢出足够完成生产队列中的下一个或多个项目时，它们也会在同一回合内完成。[PARAGRAPH:2]此规则不适用于仪式和奇观，因为那样就能通过积累溢出，在满足要求后更快地建造它们。生产溢出不会从常规生产转到用食物生产的项目上，反之亦然，否则就能靠积累足够的溢出来避免城市停止增长。用食物生产的各项目之间会像常规生产那样相互结转生产溢出。
