CIV4GameText_PuppetStates.xml	TXT_KEY_CONCEPT_PUPPET_STATES_PEDIA	[H1]Puppet States[\\H1][PARAGRAPH:2]Puppet States can be formed when a civilization with knowledge of how to form Vassal States conquers a city. Puppet States are created as a Vassal of the conquering player, and are the same civilization type as the previous city owner. Puppet States are a special type of vassal in that they don't get a Palace and are permanently a Vassal unless they achieve Legitimacy. A Puppet State achieves Legitimacy when it is the last remaining civ of it's civilization type. At that point it becomes a regular Vassal rather than a Puppet State.	[H1]傀儡国[\\H1][PARAGRAPH:2]当一个已掌握如何建立附庸国之知识的文明征服一座城市时，便可组建傀儡国。傀儡国作为征服方玩家的附庸而产生，其文明类型与该城市的前任所有者相同。傀儡国是一种特殊的附庸：它们不会获得宫殿，并且会永久作为附庸，除非它们取得“正统地位”。当一个傀儡国成为其文明类型中最后残存的文明时，便取得正统地位。到那时它就从傀儡国变为普通附庸。
